The '''lower division''' was a district of the [[city]] [[Ro Station]] on [[Pantora]]. It contained a skyway and at least one [[maintenance tower]]. Early in the [[Imperial Era]], the child [[Cloning|clone]] [[Omega]] wound up trapped at the top of a maintenance tower in the lower division while being [[Chase on Pantora|chased]] by the [[bounty hunter]] [[Fennec Shand]]. Omega nearly fell to her death from the tower, but Shand caught her as she wanted the girl alive.<ref name="Cornered" />

